{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>For you shall not bow down to another el.</b> Therefore you shall demolish his altar and show him no favor, for you have no god besides Me to honor." "<b>For YHWH — jealous is His name.</b> For His name indicates a category of being that cannot be predicated of any existent besides Him. Therefore <b>He is a jealous El</b>, to exact retribution from one who serves another alongside Him."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:28:04.189947241Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}